    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43004" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scissor</span></b> , ōris, m.
		scinde. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>One who cleaves</i> or <i>divides</i>, <i>a carver</i>,
