			6</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A kind of gladiator</i>, <i><span class="en">Inscr.
					Orell. 2569</span></i>.</div>
